Subject: Preserve original localization with native Wii32 and UTF16 storage
Upstream-base: 132cdee912111da6c9973b1dce13651f1979b07d

Keep original Load language/filename/allocator requests, callback validation,
lookup/fallback and backing lifetime. Use fixed Wii20/8-byte scalar geometry
and an explicit in-place platform endian boundary; no alternate localization
manager or game readiness. Native callback matches the actual LoadAsyncCallback
API. Preserve the original retained-file and empty-search quirks. The console
branch remains original.

